{"id":"n28073-1-7","stage":2,"title":"고급 · 高级","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28073-1-7-1","ko":"저쪽에서 걸어오는 사람은 누구야?","zh":"那边走过来的人是谁啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저쪽에서","meaning":"那边","explanation":"저쪽：那边；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"저쪽","audio":"/audio/db084e1f145d7643d7ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75761","senseId":"1","lemma":"저쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저쪽에서","audio":"/audio/a0f30eec261d165ddb9a.mp3"}},{"text":"걸어오는","meaning":"走来，走过来","explanation":"걸어오다：走来，走过来；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"걸어오다","audio":"/audio/882df61970721559170e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64368","senseId":"1","lemma":"걸어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸어오는","audio":"/audio/cde391bce07e491924e6.mp3"}},{"text":"사람은","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람은","audio":"/audio/987448c10afe56108009.mp3"}},{"text":"누구야?","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누구야","audio":"/audio/83d049d51f0354748c71.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"db084e1f145d7643","term":"저쪽","zh":"那边","audio":"/audio/db084e1f145d7643d7ae.mp3","entryId":"75761","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人远的地方或方向。","pronunciation":["저쪽"]},{"id":"882df61970721559","term":"걸어오다","zh":"走来，走过来","audio":"/audio/882df61970721559170e.mp3","entryId":"64368","definition":"朝着目的地迈开双腿移动过来。","pronunciation":["거러오다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]}],"audio":"/audio/1c0f1ce7f0b2d3e24af9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28073-1-7-2","ko":"고급 승용차에서 내린 걸 보니 사장님 같은데?","zh":"从那辆豪华轿车里下来的，看起来像是老板吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고급","meaning":"高级，高档","explanation":"고급：高级，高档。","readings":[{"term":"고급","audio":"/audio/ca1138e57a26c3f00941.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28073","senseId":"1","lemma":"고급","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고급","audio":"/audio/ca1138e57a26c3f00941.mp3"}},{"text":"승용차에서","meaning":"轿车","explanation":"승용차：轿车；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"승용차","audio":"/audio/94fc5833dfa3675d2854.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65106","senseId":"1","lemma":"승용차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승용차에서","audio":"/audio/d7d5ed30db26dcd3093e.mp3"}},{"text":"내린","meaning":"下，下去","explanation":"내리다：下，下去；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"내리다","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73353","senseId":"4","lemma":"내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내린","audio":"/audio/dab4cf54b4b426f4378a.mp3"}},{"text":"걸","meaning":"所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）","explanation":"거：所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸","audio":"/audio/6cebaf71218a575e8966.mp3"}},{"text":"보니","meaning":"推测","explanation":"보다：推测；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"20","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보니","audio":"/audio/50ecd95f90550aea6361.mp3"}},{"text":"사장님","meaning":"老板，总经理","explanation":"사장：老板，总经理；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"사장","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61274","senseId":"1","lemma":"사장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사장님","audio":"/audio/ac78a86b83f1ddbafc51.mp3"}},{"text":"같은데?","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은데","audio":"/audio/09d1b4825a769d691604.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ca1138e57a26c3f0","term":"고급","zh":"高级，高档","audio":"/audio/ca1138e57a26c3f00941.mp3","entryId":"28073","definition":"物品或设施等的质量非常好。","pronunciation":["고급"]},{"id":"94fc5833dfa3675d","term":"승용차","zh":"轿车","audio":"/audio/94fc5833dfa3675d2854.mp3","entryId":"65106","definition":"供人乘坐的汽车。","pronunciation":["승용차"]},{"id":"01d776172b3f93c3","term":"내리다","zh":"下，下去","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3","entryId":"73353","definition":"从乘坐的交通工具上出来而到某处。","pronunciation":["내리다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"推测","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"根据某事判断。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"ede38c8825edb7fb","term":"사장","zh":"老板，总经理","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3","entryId":"61274","definition":"代表公司对公司事务负责的人。","pronunciation":["사장"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a92e2c58bd4b931adb27.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.535,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28073","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":